@startuml Driver_KYC_Upload_Screen_Flow
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 15
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Driver Partner KYC & Vehicle Photo-Inspection Screen Flow

[1. Registration & Phone OTP\n(Country Code + SMS Verification)] as K1
[2. Personal Identity & License Form\n(Name, DOB, Tax ID / SSN)] as K2
[3. Driver's License Camera Scanner\n(Front & Back with Edge Detection + Anti-Glare)] as K3
[4. Biometric Facial Liveness Check\n(Active Video Selfie: Blink & Turn Head)] as K4
[5. Vehicle Registration & Insurance\n(STS & Commercial Policy Document Upload)] as K5
[6. 4-Angle Exterior Photo Inspection\n(Front, Rear, Left, Right Assisted Overlay)] as K6
[7. In-Cabin Interior Cleanliness Photo\n(Seats, Dash & Clean Trunk Verification)] as K7
[8. Fleet Affiliation & Payout Account\n(Direct Contractor vs Partner Park + Bank Account)] as K8
[9. KYC Audit Processing Radar\n(Real-Time AI Verification Status: ~2-5 min)] as K9
[10. Verification Approved & Active\n(Push Notification + 'GO ONLINE' Enabled)] as K10
[11. Verification Rejected / Re-upload\n(Highlight Blurry Photo / Expired Document)] as K11

K1 --> K2 : Phone Verified
K2 --> K3 : Tap "Scan License"
K3 --> K4 : License OCR Captured
K4 --> K5 : Liveness Confirmed
K5 --> K6 : Vehicle Docs Stored
K6 --> K7 : 4 Angles Captured (AI Approved)
K7 --> K8 : Interior Verified
K8 --> K9 : Submit Full Application
K9 --> K10 : AI / Manual Review Passed (Confidence > 0.92)
K9 --> K11 : Photo Blurry / Expired License
K11 --> K3 : Retake License Scan
K11 --> K6 : Retake Vehicle Photos
K10 --> [Driver Home Online Shift] : Tap "Start Driving"

@enduml
